  "verdict": {
    "findings": [
      {
        "gap": "Antigravity checks commands against workspacePaths[0], although native run_command executes in args.Cwd. The lifecycle child receives the first workspace as its root, so relative targets are checked against a different directory from the actual execution directory.",
        "risk": "With a ready first workspace and an unready second workspace, a command using Cwd in the second workspace can bypass that workspace's containment and readiness checks.",
        "severity": "major",
        "evidence": "plugins/pipeline-core/hooks/antigravity-pretool-guard.mjs:338-341",
        "spec_ref": "specs/sprint-nova-epic/design/2026-09-07-local-candidate-delta.md:71-79"
      },
      {
        "gap": "Codex skips the lifecycle guard for sanctioned commands, including the exact bootstrap preflight. This skips the receipt producer, while subsequent Edit/Write calls still run the receipt consumer.",
        "risk": "An accepted payload carrying agent_id and agent_type can receive GUARD-BOOTSTRAP-RECEIPT-MISSING, execute the prescribed preflight, and remain blocked because the adapter never invokes the receipt-recording branch. The supplied receipt tests exercise the lifecycle evaluator directly and miss this adapter path.",
        "severity": "major",
        "evidence": "plugins/pipeline-core/hooks/codex-pretool-guard.mjs:285-288",
        "spec_ref": "specs/sprint-nova-epic/design/2026-09-07-local-candidate-delta.md:53-56"
      },
      {
        "gap": "Slicing Trigger A emits whenever the completed single-dispatch run equals three, without recording whether that run already produced an advisory.",
        "risk": "Multiple calls in the next assistant message, or retries before the transcript advances, repeat the advisory. A memory-only evaluation of the supplied implementation produced three nudges for two calls in one message followed by a retry, violating the required deduplication and inflating advisory counts.",
        "severity": "minor",
        "evidence": "plugins/pipeline-core/hooks/guard-slicing.mjs:575-585",
        "spec_ref": "specs/sprint-nova-epic/design/2026-09-07-local-candidate-delta.md:51-52"
      }
    ],
    "deliberately_not_flagged": [
      "Explicit GUARD-LIFECYCLE-NOT-READY denial sets take precedence before override planning or consumption; the supplied tests also preserve an armed capability when this co-denial appears.",
      "The supplied native-delivery evidence distinguishes fixture validation from live host delivery. No broader live-delivery claim was inferred.",
      "Partial review: all named production artifacts, associated test coverage, specifications, guardrails and candidate evidence were examined. Complete body-by-body review of plugins/pipeline-core/hooks/guard-lifecycle-ready.test.mjs and plugins/pipeline-core/lib/human-guard-override.test.mjs was not reached within the default 24-tool review cap. Full-scope pass/fail is withheld; pass=false denotes no approval.",
      "Remaining scope/mechanics: plugins/pipeline-core/hooks/guard-lifecycle-ready.test.mjs; plugins/pipeline-core/lib/human-guard-override.test.mjs; 24 tool uses."
    ],
